2 CONT ------------------------ 
2 CONT
2 CONT Dro til sjøs 1938, var under krigen matros på forskjellige skip, dl. a. d/s Torvanger som ble torpedert 1942, senere med d/s Orwell. Fikk tuberkulose og døde 10. juli 1944 i Nova Scotia. Gravlagt i Sør-Frøya.
2 CONT
2 CONT Vdr. Torvanger: The cargo ship was torpedoed and sunk in the Atlantic Ocean (39°40′N 41°30′W) by U-84 ( Kriegsmarine) with the loss of four of her 37 crew. Some of the survivors were rescued by Ruys ( Netherlands) and others reach
2 CONC ed land in their lifeboat.
2 CONT -----
