2 TITL Salthammer family at Bastian Egge's childhood home, Ramstad ca. 1967
2 NOTE I think that it is my ex-husband Per Gunnar Klauseth that are standing between Ståle Fremstedal and Jan Salthammer
2 NOTE Thanks, Siv!
2 NOTE I belive it has to be 1967. I was born in April 1968 and are not in the pickture. Siv Klauseth
2 NOTE Thank you, Reidunn, for the correction and identifications!  I tagged people as best I could; please correct any errors.
2 NOTE The house is where Bastian and brother and sisters had their childhood at Ramstad Ramstaddal, in Sykkylven, across the fjord from Ørskog
2 NOTE from left: Johan with Arne, Reidunn sitting, Standing: Ståle, Jan, ?, Petrine, Astrid and Solveig. Sitting:  Lars and Steinar
3 CONT Hilsen Reidunn
2 NOTE The version under 'view original' was scanned at 600 dpi, so I think it's the best I can do with this small photo.  Roe made the identifications; I hope he'll add more.  
