2 NOTE This Petrie family photograph was taken just after the end of World War II.  In fact, Ron Petrie and Ken Devine, in the back row, are both still in uniform. Grandpa James and Grandma Selma Petrie are shown with all their children,
3 CONC  their children's spouses and all their grandchildren. I am the youngest, sitting on my mother's lap on the far right. I had been born in February 1945 just before the end of the war. - Dave Petrie
