2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mand tal 1701''' [https://www.romsdal-sogelag.no/uploads/kjeldeskrift/1965_romsdahlens_fougderies_mandtal_1701.pdf Flade]
2 CONT
2 CONT Siur 80
