1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Robert Easterbrook was a WWI Veteran, He was also a survivor of the doomed troopship "SS Tuscania" which was torpedoed in the evening of Feb. 5, 1918 off the coast of Ireland. Robert was buried in the Lynden Cemete
2 CONC ry, his parents were buried in the Sumas Cemetery.
