2 CONT Begravet som smedmester '''Jens Hammeraas''' på [https://www.disnorge.no/gravminner/bilde.php?id=5777220 Kirkelandet], Kristiansund.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jens Rasmussen Hammeraas was a successful blacksmith and active politician and member of the Salvation Army. He lived in Kristiansund, was married twice, and has many descendants.
2 CONT
2 CONT According to the great-grandchild Lars Chr Hammeraas Aure, he asked his uncle Lars Jensen Hammeraas (the famous shipbuilder) to use the last name "Hammeraas", as there were so many Jens/Rasmus/Lars with the last name Vestnes. He g
2 CONC ot permission.
