1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Klaras Film.
2 CONT
2 CONT Det ser ut for at hun besøkte Norge og Sunnmøre i 1948. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=e78IiQhMCxo
2 CONT
2 CONT En flott reiseskildring i farger . Mye av det som er tatt fremst i Stordalen er fra Seljehaug.
2 CONT Nå eid av familien Arne Birkevold 
2 CONT
2 CONT Arne Almås 06.02.2022
2 CONT
2 CONT '''The Vancouver Sun
2 CONT Vancouver, British Columbia, Canada
2 CONT 15 apr 1963'''
2 CONT
2 CONT WIKE Klara Josephine Wike .
2 CONT Inte of 2933 160th St .. White Rock .
2 CONT BC . passed away April 12. 1963 .
2 CONT Aged 66 years . Survived by her
2 CONT loving husband Lars : one son .
2 CONT Hans Haus . New Westminster : one
2 CONT daughter . Mrs. Kari Plut . Sentile ,
2 CONT Washington : one brother . Einar ,
2 CONT Burnaby : two brothers . Lars and
2 CONT Olaf , Norway : five grandchildren :
2 CONT two cousins . Everett , Washington .
2 CONT Funeral services will be held in
2 CONT Westminster , Tuesday , April 15th Funeral New
2 CONT at 1:30 p.m. Reverend J. S. Stolee
2 CONT officiating .
