0 @N6000000002409195172@ NOTE [export.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT JENSINE EGGE CAME TO AMERICA WITH HER MOTHER TO HELP HER SISTER OLINE WHO HAD 4 CHILDREN UNDER THE AGE OF 4.
1 CONT She met her husband when she was a cook at the Lutheran Brethren School in Grand Forks, ND
